<details><summary>How do I use my code?</summary><div class="a"><p>Book the service you chose, then show your code at check-in and tell us the email address you signed up with. We match both to our records and take 20% off one session of it.</p></div></details><details><summary>Which services can I choose from?</summary><div class="a"><p>Any service on our menu: IV therapy, vitamin injections, injectables, laser and skin treatments, hormone therapy, wellness coaching and medical weight loss programs. You pick one when you claim your code. Prescription treatments require a clinical evaluation first.</p></div></details><details><summary>Can I use it on more than one service?</summary><div class="a"><p>No. Each code covers the single service you selected when you claimed it.</p></div></details><details><summary>What if my treatment needs several sessions?</summary><div class="a"><p>The discount applies to one session. If you book a package or a multi-session course, we take 20% off a single session of it, not off the whole package.</p></div></details><details><summary>Is this for new patients only?</summary><div class="a"><p>No. New and existing patients can each claim one code.</p></div></details><details><summary>Can I combine it with other offers?</summary><div class="a"><p>No. One code per person, used once, and it cannot be combined with other promotions or sale pricing.</p></div></details><details><summary>Is the first consultation free?</summary><div class="a"><p>Yes. New patient consultations are free, with no deposit. You leave with a plan and exact pricing before you decide on anything.</p></div></details><details><summary>Does the code expire?</summary><div class="a"><p>There is no end date right now. The offer can change or end, and the current terms are always on this page.</p></div></details><details><summary>I did not get my email. What now?</summary><div class="a"><p>Check your Promotions and Spam folders first. If you sign up again with the same email, we resend the same code. Still nothing? Call us at 972-891-8650.</p></div></details>
